From 083fc11e409d3d6f7120a8f061381a2b50dc4fdd Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: OneFeiFan <3022504358@qq.com>
Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 01:52:57 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] sched: add kABI-safe CFS bandwidth support
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Keep the bandwidth state in separately allocated objects and hide the cfs_rq pointer from genksyms. The pointer sits in the cfs_rq tail padding at 472, android_vendor_data1 stays at 344 and the struct size stays 512; static asserts pin all three.

Enable CFS_BANDWIDTH in gki_defconfig in this patch, so it is never
built with the stock inline cfs_rq layout.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Code <noreply@anthropic.com>

Origin: 移植自 Goldzxcbug/Droidspaces_Kernel_patch cgroup_limits/fix_cgroup_limits_kabi_5.15.167.patch 的 CFS 部分（cfs_bandwidth_state 拆分）；cfs_rq 尾部填充位置为本地设计
Upstream-Status: Not-Applicable
KABI: task_group ANDROID_KABI_USE(2) + RESERVE(1)(3)；cfs_rq 尾部填充 472，android_vendor_data1 344，大小 512
Depends-On: none
Tested-On: yudi 5.10.272（CFS 配额 20%）, 2026-10-29
---
 arch/arm64/configs/gki_defconfig |   2 +
 kernel/sched/core.c              |  39 +++++---
 kernel/sched/debug.c             |   4 +-
 kernel/sched/fair.c              | 164 +++++++++++++++++--------------
 kernel/sched/pelt.h              |   9 +-
 kernel/sched/sched.h             |  72 +++++++++++---
 6 files changed, 182 insertions(+), 108 deletions(-)

diff --git a/arch/arm64/configs/gki_defconfig b/arch/arm64/configs/gki_defconfig
index d1b2b2e79..8f6c29c0b 100644
